    sh:description "The value of the \"Course of Study Code\" column of the original data."@en, "元データの「学習指導要領コード」列の値。"@ja "The value of the \"Text of Course of Study\" column of the original data."@en, "元データの「学習指導要領テキスト」列の値。"@ja "It is the section number hierarchy in the course fo study text. It is created automatically by the program. Half-size katakana is converted to full-size katakana."@en, "学習指導要領テキスト中の節番号の全階層分を表す。プログラムで自動作成。半角カタカナは全角カタカナに変換。"@ja "Link to the corresponding Course of Study Commentary with this item."@en, "対応する学習指導要領解説へのリンク"@ja "It corresponds to the second digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの2桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the second digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの2桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 3rd digit of the course of study code."@en, "元データの「教科等」列の値。学習指導要領コードの3桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 4th digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの4桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 6th digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの6桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 6th digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの6桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 5th digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの5桁目に対応"@ja "It corresponds to the 7th digit of the course of study code."@en, "学習指導要領コードの7桁目に対応"@ja "It is the section number in the course fo study text. It is created automatically by the program. Half-size katakana is converted to full-size katakana."@en, "学習指導要領テキスト中の節番号を表す。ないこともある。プログラムで自動作成。半角カタカナは全角カタカナに変換。"@ja "It is text without section number in the course fo study text. It is created automatically by the program. Half-size katakana is converted to full-size katakana."@en, "学習指導要領テキスト中の節番号を除いたテキスト。プログラムで自動作成。半角カタカナは全角カタカナに変換。"@ja "Child of the cource of study item. It is created automatically by the program using the regularity of the course of study code."@en, "子供の学習指導要領細目を表す。学習指導要領コードの規則性を利用してプログラムで自動作成。"@ja "Basic items of the Course of Study. Created from the Commentary on the Course of Study and related sources. A  Basic item of the Course of Study consists of a blank node, which has two properties <code>rdf:value</code> and <code>dct:provenance</code>."@en, "当該学習指導要領細目の基礎となる細目。学習指導要領解説などから作成する。<code>rdf:value</code>, <code>dct:provenance</code>の2つの項番用プロパティを持つ。"@ja "Advanced items of the Course of Study. Created from the Commentary on the Course of Study and related sources. A  Advanced item of the Course of Study consists of a blank node, which has two properties <code>rdf:value</code> and <code>dct:provenance</code>."@en, "当該学習指導要領細目の応用となる細目。学習指導要領解説などから作成する。<code>rdf:value</code>, <code>dct:provenance</code>の2つの項番用プロパティを持つ。"@ja;
